## @ross-sec/sync-od

Not bundled here, and not a dependency. It is referenced at runtime only: the handoff
prompt this project emits tells the receiving coding agent to push its changes back to
Open Design with `@ross-sec/sync-od`, which is the reverse direction and a separate
package. Nothing in this repository links against or redistributes it.
